      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Scroll: mouse wheel / Up & Down / right stick\n\n<b>DEVELOPMENT</b>\nThibaud
    von Borowski\nJordan TCHA\nAntoine BASSET\n\n<b>3D ART & ANIMATION</b>\nEric
    Tran-Ky\n\n<b>COMMUNICATIONS</b>\nH\xE9l\xE8ne TEA & Mathis Duclos\n\n<b>UI /
    UX</b>\nEdouard FORT & Eric Tran-Ky\n\n<b>AUDIOVISUAL PRODUCTION</b>\nEric Tran-Ky
    & Edouard FORT\n\n<b>PROJECT MANAGEMENT</b>\nEdouard FORT, Eric Tran-Ky & Helene
    TEA\n\n<b>EMOTIONAL SUPPORT</b>\nGwendal Judic & Robin Alonzo\n\n<b>DRINKS SUPPORT</b>\nCathy
    Duclos\n\n<b>FOOD SUPPORT</b>\nLa Fancy, HFC, Burger King & Super U\n\n<b>SPECIAL
    THANKS</b>\nGwendal Judic, Arthur Centim\xE8tre, Robin Alonzo,\nJulien BERTRAND,
    GIROUX GUILLAUME,\nHEURARD MAEL\n\n<b>WITH THANKS TO</b>\nBordeaux Montaigne
    University\nBordeaux Montaigne University Institute of Technology (IUT)\n\n<b>3D
    ASSET SOURCES</b>\nPoly Pizza \u2014 poly.pizza\nSketchfab \u2014 sketchfab.com\nThanks
    to the artists who shared their work.\n\n<b>MUSIC</b>\nWhat We Got \u2014 Infraction\n\n<b>SOUND
    EFFECTS</b>\nHeavy Wings Flapping \u2014 Dragon Studio\n\n<b>VISUAL EFFECTS</b>\nCinematic
    Explosions FREE \u2014 Mirza Beig\n\n<b>ENGINE & UI TECHNOLOGY</b>\nUnity & TextMesh
    Pro\n\nThanks for riding with us!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
